        "ه عن سلمة بن تمام صاحب أمير المؤمنين عليه السّلام‌."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "And whatever is narrated from Salamah ibn Tammam, the companion of Amir Al-Muʾminin, peace be upon him, I have narrated it from my father - may Allah (swt) be pleased with him - from Saʿd ibn Abdullah, from Ahmad ibn Muhammad ibn ʿIsa, from Al-Husayn ibn Saʿid, from Hammad ibn ʿIsa, from Hariz, from Salamah ibn Tammam, the companion of Amir Al-Muʾminin, peace be upon him."
        ]
      }
